#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:352
msgid ""
"Copies a struct from userspace to kernel space, in a way that guarantees "
"backwards-compatibility for struct syscall arguments (as long as future "
"struct extensions are made such that all new fields are *appended* to the "
"old struct, and zeroed-out new fields have the same meaning as the old "
"struct)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:358
msgid ""
"**ksize** is just sizeof(*dst), and **usize** should've been passed by "
"userspace. The recommended usage is something like the following::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:378
#: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:474
msgid "There are three cases to consider:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:379
#: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:475
msgid "If **usize** == **ksize**, then it's copied verbatim."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:380
msgid ""
"If **usize** < **ksize**, then the userspace has passed an old struct to a "
"newer kernel. The rest of the trailing bytes in **dst** (**ksize** - "
"**usize**) are to be zero-filled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:383
msgid ""
"If **usize** > **ksize**, then the userspace has passed a new struct to an "
"older kernel. The trailing bytes unknown to the kernel (**usize** - "
"**ksize**) are checked to ensure they are zeroed, otherwise -E2BIG is "
"returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:387
#: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:485
msgid "Returns (in all cases, some data may have been copied):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:388
msgid ""
"-E2BIG:  (**usize** > **ksize**) and there are non-zero trailing bytes in "
"**src**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:389
#: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:486
msgid "-EFAULT: access to userspace failed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:11: ../include/linux/uaccess.h:418
msgid "copy a struct to userspace"
msgstr ""

