"Calculate the expected folio refcount, taking references from the pagecache, "
"swapcache, private data (folio->private != NULL) and page table mappings "
"into account. Useful in combination with folio_ref_count() to detect "
"unexpected references (e.g., GUP or other temporary references)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:119: ../include/linux/mm.h:3178
msgid ""
"Does currently not consider references from the LRU cache. If the folio was "
"isolated from the LRU (which is the case during migration or split), the LRU "
"cache does not apply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:119: ../include/linux/mm.h:3182
